@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@postId = 6a0cfa52fca52fb6fb01f0fb
@commentId = REPLACE_WITH_COMMENT_ID

### ─── POSTS ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create a post
POST {{base}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Getting Started with DocumentDB",
  "content": "DocumentDB is a JSON-native NoSQL database that speaks the MongoDB wire protocol...",
  "author": "Alice",
  "tags": ["nosql", "documentdb", "tutorial"],
  "published": false
}

###

### Create a second post (published)
POST {{base}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced Aggregation Pipelines",
  "content": "Aggregation lets you transform and compute over documents in stages...",
  "author": "Bob",
  "tags": ["nosql", "aggregation"],
  "published": true
}

###

### Get all posts (defaults: page=1, limit=10, sortBy=createdAt, sortOrder=desc)
GET {{base}}/posts

###

### Pagination
GET {{base}}/posts?page=2&limit=5

###

### Get only published posts
GET {{base}}/posts?published=true

###

### Filter by author + sort by title ascending
GET {{base}}/posts?author=Bob&sortBy=title&sortOrder=asc

###

### Filter by tag + paginate
GET {{base}}/posts?tag=nosql&page=1&limit=5

###

### All filters combined
GET {{base}}/posts?published=true&author=Bob&tag=nosql&page=1&limit=10&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc

###

### Get a single post
GET {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}

###

### Update a post (partial — only fields provided are changed)
PATCH {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Getting Started with DocumentDB (Updated)",
  "tags": ["nosql", "documentdb", "tutorial", "updated"]
}

###

### Publish a post
PATCH {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}/publish

###

### Delete a post
DELETE {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}

###

### ─── VALIDATION ERRORS ───────────────────────────────────

### Create post — missing required fields (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

###

### Create post — title too long (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA",
  "content": "Some content",
  "author": "Alice"
}

###

### ─── COMMENTS ────────────────────────────────────────────

### Add a comment to a post
POST {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Carol",
  "content": "Great intro! Really helped me understand DocumentDB."
}

###

### Add a second comment
POST {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Dave",
  "content": "Could you cover indexing strategies in a follow-up?"
}

###

### Get all comments for a post (defaults: page=1, limit=10, sortOrder=asc)
GET {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments

###

### Comments — paginated, newest first
GET {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments?page=1&limit=5&sortOrder=desc

###

### Update a comment
PATCH {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Great intro! Really helped me understand DocumentDB. Looking forward to more!"
}

###

### Delete a comment
DELETE {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments/{{commentId}}

###

### Comment — content too long (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Spammer",
  "content": ""
}
